   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The near future",
     "texto": [
      "To talk about plans, use **aller** in the present + **infinitive**, like «going to» in English, but **with no «to»**: **Je vais voir mes parents** (I'm going to see my parents).",
      "Negative: **Je ne vais pas travailler**. Question: **Qu'est-ce que tu vas faire ?**",
      "Future words: **demain** (tomorrow), **ce soir** (tonight), **ce week-end** (this weekend), **la semaine prochaine** (next week)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "The near future",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Person",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "aller + infinitive",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
